    @SerialName("params") val params: Argon2Spec,
    /** The setup-time signature by ADK(1) over "sa-recoverykey-v1|" + b64u(public_key). A rotating client verifies it with the verify_key(1) it derives from its own ADK(1) before wrapping a new ADK to public_key, and refuses otherwise. Null for legacy accounts set up before it existed (clients refuse to rotate). The recovery public key never changes after setup (docs/ADR/0015-authenticated-recovery-key.md). */
    @SerialName("signature") val signature: Signature? = null,
)

